@startuml cu38
!theme plain
title CU38 — Eliminar tipo de documento

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to delete a document type.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows a list of every available document type.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects one and confirms its deletion.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Deletes the selected document.
System -> System : System

@enduml